1. ELECTRICAL

1a. The pack and the gauge's capacity words (BQ4050 data flash; SLUUAQ3A 14.13.5):
   4S3P: 12 cells, nominal 144.7 Wh (12 x 3.35 Ah x 3.60 V); Design Capacity 10050 mAh (min) or 10350 (typ 3.45 Ah), 14472 cWh; limit 32767: fits
   4S6P: 24 cells, nominal 289.4 Wh (24 x 3.35 Ah x 3.60 V); Design Capacity 20100 mAh (min) or 20700 (typ 3.45 Ah), 28944 cWh; limit 32767: fits

1b. Balancing: the internal bypass (RCB 200 ohm) through two 100 ohm tap filters at 3.9 V: 9.75 mA (SLUSC67B 8.2.2.3.1: the series
   resistors set the current). Time to move 1 percent of a series group's minimum capacity: 4S3P 10.3 h, 4S6P 20.6 h.
   It acts on a west group only through the equalising link of that node (the gauge's taps are on the east block).

1c. Currents per cell (the pack's current is the kit's load: parallel cells share it, the ratings do not rise):
